templates.body:
Dear {{customer_name}},

Thank you for choosing {{bank_name}}. Your account opening process has been completed successfully.

Account details:
- Account type: {{account_type}}
- Account reference: {{masked_account_reference}}
- Activation status: {{activation_status}}

For your protection, we will never ask you to share your password, PIN, or one-time password by email.

For assistance, contact our official support team using the contact details on {{official_website}}.

Regards,
Customer Service Team
{{bank_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

A transaction has been recorded on your {{bank_name}} account.

Transaction details:
- Type: {{transaction_type}}
- Amount: {{amount}}
- Date and time: {{date_time}}
- Reference number: {{transaction_reference}}
- Account: {{masked_account_number}}

If you do not recognise this transaction, contact the institution through its official app, website, or published phone number.

Regards,
Transaction Monitoring Team
{{bank_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

Your account statement for {{statement_month}} is now available.

Statement details:
- Account reference: {{masked_account_number}}
- Statement period: {{start_date}} to {{end_date}}
- Generated on: {{generation_date}}

Access your statement securely through the official banking app or by visiting {{official_website}}.

Please do not share your banking credentials with anyone.

Regards,
Account Services Team
{{bank_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

A login to your online banking account was detected.

Activity details:
- Date and time: {{date_time}}
- Device: {{device}}
- Approximate location: {{location}}

If you recognise this activity, no action is required. If you do not, contact the institution using the official contact details published on {{official_website}}.

Regards,
Digital Banking Security Team
{{bank_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

Your {{card_type}} card has been dispatched.

Dispatch details:
- Card: {{masked_card_number}}
- Dispatch date: {{dispatch_date}}
- Courier: {{courier_name}}
- Tracking reference: {{tracking_number}}
- Expected delivery: {{expected_delivery_date}}

Track your delivery: {{tracking_url}}

Never share your card PIN, CVV, or one-time password.

Regards,
Card Services Team
{{bank_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

Thank you for applying for a loan with {{bank_name}}. Your application status has been updated.

Application reference: {{application_id}}
Loan type: {{loan_type}}
Current status: {{application_status}}
Next step: {{next_step}}

Check your application through the official portal: {{application_url}}

Regards,
Loan Services Team
{{bank_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

Thank you for contacting {{bank_name}}. We have successfully registered your complaint.

Complaint reference: {{complaint_id}}
Date received: {{complaint_date}}
Issue category: {{issue_category}}
Expected response timeline: {{response_timeline}}

You can track your complaint through {{complaint_tracking_url}}.

Regards,
Customer Resolution Team
{{bank_name}}

Dear {{customer_name}},

We would like to inform you about an upcoming change to our banking services.

Service: {{service_name}}
Effective date: {{effective_date}}
Details of the change: {{change_description}}
Customer action required: {{customer_action}}

For further information, visit {{official_website}} or contact our official support team.

Thank you for banking with us.

Regards,
Customer Communications Team
{{bank_name}}
